Database migrations (Alembic). Run from the backend/ folder with the venv active.

  alembic upgrade head                                  # apply all migrations
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"  # after editing app/models/*
  alembic downgrade -1                                  # undo the last migration
  alembic current                                       # show the DB's revision

Always read a generated migration before applying it: autogenerate can miss renames.
